{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":80,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the chief Musician upon Shoshannim-eduth, A Psalm of Asaph.","tok":[{"t":"To the chief "},{"t":"Musician","s":["H5329"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon "},{"t":"Shoshannim-eduth","s":["H7802"]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Asaph","s":["H0623"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1,"text":"Give ear, O Shepherd of Israel, thou that leadest Joseph like a flock; thou that dwellest between the cherubims, shine forth.","tok":[{"t":"Give "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0238"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Shepherd","s":["H7462"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[1]},{"t":", thou that "},{"t":"leadest","s":["H5090"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Joseph","s":["H3130"],"a":[5]},{"t":" like a "},{"t":"flock","s":["H6629"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; thou that "},{"t":"dwellest","s":["H3427"],"a":[6]},{"t":" between the "},{"t":"cherubims","s":["H3742"],"a":[7]},{"t":", shine "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3313"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Before Ephraim and Benjamin and Manasseh stir up thy strength, and come and save us.","tok":[{"t":"Before","s":["H6440"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Benjamin","s":["H1144"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Manasseh","s":["H4519"],"a":[3]},{"t":" stir "},{"t":"up","s":["H5782"],"a":[4]},{"t":" thy "},{"t":"strength","s":["H1369"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"save","s":["H3444"],"a":[8]},{"t":" us."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Turn us again, O God, and cause thy face to shine; and we shall be saved.","tok":[{"t":"Turn us "},{"t":"again","s":["H7725"],"a":[1]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and cause thy "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"shine","s":["H0215"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; and we shall be "},{"t":"saved","s":["H3467"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"O LORD God of hosts, how long wilt thou be angry against the prayer of thy people?","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[2]},{"t":", how long wilt thou be "},{"t":"angry","s":["H6225"],"a":[5]},{"t":" against the "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of thy "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":5,"text":"Thou feedest them with the bread of tears; and givest them tears to drink in great measure.","tok":[{"t":"Thou "},{"t":"feedest","s":["H0398"],"a":[0]},{"t":" them with the "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; and givest them "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8248"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in great "},{"t":"measure","s":["H7991"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Thou makest us a strife unto our neighbours: and our enemies laugh among themselves.","tok":[{"t":"Thou "},{"t":"makest","s":["H7760"],"a":[0]},{"t":" us a "},{"t":"strife","s":["H4066"],"a":[1]},{"t":" unto our "},{"t":"neighbours","s":["H7934"],"a":[2]},{"t":": and our "},{"t":"enemies","s":["H0341"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"laugh","s":["H3932"],"a":[4]},{"t":" among themselves."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Turn us again, O God of hosts, and cause thy face to shine; and we shall be saved.","tok":[{"t":"Turn us "},{"t":"again","s":["H7725"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and cause thy "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"shine","s":["H0215"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; and we shall be "},{"t":"saved","s":["H3467"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Thou hast brought a vine out of Egypt: thou hast cast out the heathen, and planted it.","tok":[{"t":"Thou hast "},{"t":"brought","s":["H5265"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[0]},{"t":" out of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[1]},{"t":": thou hast cast "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"heathen","s":["H1471"],"a":[4]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"planted","s":["H5193"],"a":[5]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Thou preparedst room before it, and didst cause it to take deep root, and it filled the land.","tok":[{"t":"Thou "},{"t":"preparedst","s":["H6437"],"a":[0]},{"t":" room "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[1]},{"t":" it, and didst cause it to take "},{"t":"deep","s":["H8328"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"root","s":["H8327"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and it "},{"t":"filled","s":["H4390"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"The hills were covered with the shadow of it, and the boughs thereof were like the goodly cedars.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"hills","s":["H2022"],"a":[1]},{"t":" were "},{"t":"covered","s":["H3680"],"a":[0]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"shadow","s":["H6738"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of it, and the "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H6057"],"a":[3]},{"t":" thereof were like the "},{"t":"goodly","s":["H0410"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cedars","s":["H0730"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"She sent out her boughs unto the sea, and her branches unto the river.","tok":[{"t":"She sent "},{"t":"out","s":["H7971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H7105"],"a":[1]},{"t":" unto the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and her "},{"t":"branches","s":["H3127"],"a":[6]},{"t":" unto the "},{"t":"river","s":["H5104"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Why hast thou then broken down her hedges, so that all they which pass by the way do pluck her?","tok":[{"t":"Why hast thou then broken "},{"t":"down","s":["H6555"],"a":[1]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"hedges","s":["H1447"],"a":[2]},{"t":", so that all they which "},{"t":"pass","s":["H5674"],"a":[5]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[6]},{"t":" do "},{"t":"pluck","s":["H0717"],"a":[3]},{"t":" her?"}]},{"n":13,"text":"The boar out of the wood doth waste it, and the wild beast of the field doth devour it.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"boar","s":["H2386"],"a":[1]},{"t":" out of the "},{"t":"wood","s":["H32